            %p
              More explicitly, in terms of the spaces from def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#FunctionsOnTwiddleD"}
              we may identify
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
