                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} U \times \tilde D(dim U, n)
              is thought of as a base point
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi x
