          #CEAlgebraFromNormalizedCochains.num_prop
            %h6#proposition_9 Proposition
            %p
              The normalized cochain complex of the cosimplicial alghebra of functions on this
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
